&lt;p data-start=&quot;3364&quot; data-end=&quot;3475&quot;&gt;Analytical mindset with attention to detail, capable of identifying and leveraging data-driven opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;3476&quot; data-end=&quot;3593&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3478&quot; data-end=&quot;3593&quot;&gt;Proven experience using Salesforce CRM to manage pipelines, forecast revenue, and drive sales process discipline.&lt;/p&gt;
