&lt;p&gt;工作內容：&lt;br&gt;我們正在尋找一位具備深厚消防專業知識與實務經驗的消防安全經理，負責物流中心（FC）消防安全的全面規劃與執行。此角色將直接影響營運安全與法規合規，並與政府機關密切協作，確保消防系統的設置與維護符合最高標準。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;主要職責包括：&lt;br&gt;• 擔任消防安全負責人，制定並推動符合《消防法》及相關法規的消防安全計畫。&lt;br&gt;• 規劃並執行消防演練與緊急應變措施，提升員工在突發狀況下的應變能力。&lt;br&gt;• 主導消防系統（消防水、消防電）新建、室內裝修變更及年度檢修申報等實作工作。&lt;br&gt;• 定期監控消防設備運作狀況，規劃維護時程，確保系統穩定與合規。&lt;br&gt;• 與政府機關（如消防局火災預防科）協調會審、會勘事宜，並主導相關案件之申報與溝通。&lt;br&gt;• 確保遵循政府法規（建築、消防、安全、公共危險物品管理等）及公司內部規範，達成物流中心營運目標。&lt;br&gt;• 辨識並評估專案執行過程中的潛在風險，並在問題發生時主導排解。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;資格條件：&lt;br&gt;• 消防安全、消防科學或相關領域之學士學位佳&lt;br&gt;• 至少 7 年以上消防安全相關經驗，具企業、工業或主管機關背景者尤佳。&lt;br&gt;• 熟悉消防法、《公共危險物品及可燃性高壓氣體製造儲存處理場所設置標準暨安全管理辦法》等相關法規與標準。&lt;br&gt;• 具備消防系統實作經驗（新建、變更、年度檢修申報），能獨立主導並確保合規。&lt;br&gt;• 曾參與或主辦與消防局協調之會審、會勘案件，具良好公部門溝通能力。&lt;br&gt;• 優異的溝通與人際互動能力，能與組織各層級有效協作與影響決策。&lt;br&gt;• 具備以下證照者尤佳：消防設備師（士）、防火管理人、保安監督人。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;31&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;multilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7946264.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAP &amp;nbsp;Solution Architect – Coupang&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We exist to wow our customers. We know we’re doing the right thing when we hear our customers say, &lt;em&gt;“How did we ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/em&gt; Born out of an obsession to make shopping, eating, and living easier than ever, we are collectively disrupting the multi‑billion‑dollar commerce industry from the ground up and establishing an unparalleled reputation for being a leading and reliable force in South Korean commerce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to have the best of both worlds — a startup culture with the resources of a large global public company. This fuels us to continue our growth and launch new services at the speed we have been at since our inception. We are all entrepreneurial, surrounded by opportunities to drive new initiatives and innovations. At our core, we are bold and ambitious people who like to get our hands dirty and make a meaningful impact. At Coupang, you will see yourself, your colleagues, your team, and the company grow every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission to build the future of commerce is real. We push the boundaries of what’s possible to solve problems and break traditional trade‑offs. Join Coupang now to create an epic experience in this always‑on, high‑tech, and hyper‑connected world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;strong&gt;SAP S/4HANA Solution Architect&lt;/strong&gt;, you will define and drive Coupang’s SAP transformation across key business domains including Finance, Supply Chain, Procurement, Logistics, and Operations. You will partner with business leaders, technology teams, and global stakeholders to design scalable, integrated SAP S/4HANA solutions aligned with Coupang’s rapid growth and evolving business landscape.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be responsible for leading solution architecture, defining end‑to‑end business process designs, guiding technical teams, and ensuring SAP platforms meet enterprise‑class standards in performance, reliability, integration, and security. This role will directly influence Coupang’s core operational systems and will require strong expertise in SAP S/4HANA, cross‑functional process knowledge, and enterprise‑level architecture skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will additionally contribute to building the Coupang India Technology Center and help establish best practices, engineering culture, and cross‑region collaboration frameworks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the architecture and design of SAP S/4HANA solutions across modules such as FI/CO, MM, SD, PP, EWM, and TM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect end‑to‑end business processes aligned to Coupang’s e‑commerce, logistics, and fulfillment operations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define integration patterns between SAP S/4HANA and internal Coupang systems (OMS, WMS, Finance systems, 3rd‑party applications)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain the SAP enterprise architecture roadmap, ensuring alignment with long‑term business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide expert guidance on SAP best practices, data models, extensibility (BTP), Fiori UX, and cloud deployment models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review functional and technical specifications to ensure architectural consistency and solution quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with business, product, and engineering teams across multiple geographies to design scalable, high‑performance SAP solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for automation, process improvement, and system optimization within the SAP landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor SAP functional and technical teams; drive architectural governance and design reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure SAP platforms meet enterprise‑class SLAs for performance, reliability, availability, and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support major SAP initiatives including S/4HANA rollouts, upgrades, migrations, and greenfield/brownfield implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Basic Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or master’s degree in computer science, Information Systems, Engineering, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;12–18+ years of overall experience with at least 8–10 years in SAP S/4HANA solution architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep hands‑on expertise across multiple SAP modules (FI/CO, MM, SD, PP, EWM, TM, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience designing large‑scale enterprise SAP landscapes and integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of SAP BTP, Fiori, CDS Views, IDocs, and API Hub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading multi‑country/multi‑business‑unit SAP transformations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and cross‑functional collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in fast‑paced, ambiguous, high‑growth environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in e‑commerce, retail, logistics, or large‑scale supply chain organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands‑on SAP S/4HANA implementation experience in greenfield or brownfield programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with cloud‑based SAP deployments (AWS, Azure, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of architecture frameworks and methodologies (TOGAF, SAP Activate)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to distributed, global SAP teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Type of work model&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;38&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:880,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:440,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hybrid&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our Hybrid work model: Coupang hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration that acts a catalyst to enrich the experience of employees. Employees are required to work at least 3 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 2 days a week, depending on the role requirement. Some businesses may require more time in office due to nature of work.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Details to consider&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245417&amp;quot;:false}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
