&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software engineering management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of software development experience in languages like C++, Java, Python or Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven expertise in managing projects throughout the entire SDLC, delivering products to market on schedule, and ensuring feedback loops from customers into development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong customer focus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience introducing and growing an agile (Scrum) environment with short cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid knowledge of end-to-end quality best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated strong analytical and problem solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communications skills&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
